    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff1a48faf93391adb2b160d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "活动不仅能以班级为单位，也可由所属队伍或\n自发小组，甚至个人举办――\n但空中救世主如今正忙于比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dd47655017189b50d78e3f6e6738930ad2a1d8b24b06ce0c4bfc551434e536d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
