    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba675041e1c3202db60fd522",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主正顺利地不断进食！\n但，其他参赛者也在猛烈追赶……！\n激烈拉锯的结果是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "17ed7d1e706d7a173e6a3c55cd07f6de1d962cbc91c2533f91df55a0bb771d85",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        71,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/71/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b88539640b70e1610b496b6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不，你已经很努力了……！",
