      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有朝一日，请您再为我做一次。\n今天的土豆炖肉……好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0aa25cb0a88bee96871dc190c9aa2817aa38769f0c57cc071332f1761eb4b9c0",
