      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到时候，请让我一口一口地品尝。\n然后，细细体会那份滋味……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d9fa30c7f9046a75cbcd48e502c28d97ac13606354ece4c6fd82b3a6a0286d5",
