      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再把感想，告诉您。\n……因为它真的，真的，非常美味。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c94bcca47c1c3a8ba3702fe631411613b8a024264373017e42c322a559b85a7f",
